This right here is what fucks up raising capital by means of equitable ownership as a pose to debt. A company will say something like the following... did they just publicly explain additional shares for general corporate purposes and investments? 

Are you fucking serious? Fire the PR staff and fire who the head of pr answers to. That sounds like yall issued more shares potentially diluting your existing original ride or die share holders and your explanation is for possible strippers and Investments? Investments in what? A new lambo so you can pick up a soulless woman at the Newport yaht club? This is exactly what I was talking about when I spoke of skepticism amongst analysts and investors when it comes ti additional shares being issued not dimension the owner unloading a shit ton. Fuckn A redcat! I hope who decided to approve this release of info with this unparalleled level of apathy for yoir share holders and employees. Yall deserve a big red cat gifting you big red herpes and syphilis and chlamydia for reporting something so stupid  that syphilis has spread to your brain like Henry tye 8th or AL capone.  I cannot believe they released that.

